<title>BELARUS: Belarus November unemployment rises to 186,400.</title>
<headline>Belarus November unemployment rises to 186,400.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Belarus rose to 186,400 at the end of November from 185,200 at the end of October, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BELARUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	NOV 96     OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p> number of unemployed	    186,400    185,200    127,000</p>
<p> percentage of workforce	 3.9	  3.9	  2.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Official Belarussian information tends to understate unemployment levels.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
